(7204175, 1109227, 153814, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp shot. Well done.</td>', 'Nice crisp shot. Well done.', '2014-04-16 09:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7204176, 1109207, 153814, '<td valign="top">Wow what a great shot. Great detail and look at that iridescence.<br/>Well done.</td>', 'Wow what a great shot. Great detail and look at that iridescence.Well done.', '2014-04-16 09:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7204181, 1108770, 67258, '<td valign="top">These are mainly a winter bird here in Britain - a good portrait, the catchlight adds hugely.</td>', 'These are mainly a winter bird here in Britain - a good portrait, the catchlight adds hugely.', '2014-04-16 09:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7204185, 1109227, 129147, '<td valign="top">Enjoy the colors, nice sharpness.</td>', 'Enjoy the colors, nice sharpness.', '2014-04-16 09:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7204186, 1109422, 129147, '<td valign="top">My pick to win!</td>', 'My pick to win!', '2014-04-16 09:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7204187, 1108946, 67258, '<td valign="top">Excellent exposure, and gorgeous light on the bird.</td>', 'Excellent exposure, and gorgeous light on the bird.', '2014-04-16 09:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7204189, 1109289, 129147, '<td valign="top">Top 3, enjoy the perspective.</td>', 'Top 3, enjoy the perspective.', '2014-04-16 09:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7204191, 1108788, 100831, '<td valign="top">Peace at last.</td>', 'Peace at last.', '2014-04-16 09:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7204192, 1109133, 129147, '<td valign="top">Must have been awesome to see a Jaguar outside a zoo!</td>', 'Must have been awesome to see a Jaguar outside a zoo!', '2014-04-16 09:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7204194, 1108790, 67258, '<td valign="top">Ha, great timing and adds some real interest.  I wonder if you could have pushed the saturation slightly, there is a slightly ''muddy'' feel to the photo as presented.  This looks to be an Oyster Catcher, and their orange does tend to be very bright.</td>', 'Ha, great timing and adds some real interest.  I wonder if you could have pushed the saturation slightly, there is a slightly ''muddy'' feel to the photo as presented.  This looks to be an Oyster Catcher, and their orange does tend to be very bright.', '2014-04-16 09:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7204196, 1109172, 129147, '<td valign="top">Interesting crop.</td>', 'Interesting crop.', '2014-04-16 09:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7204197, 1108800, 67258, '<td valign="top">A pleasing portrait, and a super reflection - I do get an idea of place, which I like in wildlife photographs.  I''m not absolutely convinced by the framing, ''though.</td>', 'A pleasing portrait, and a super reflection - I do get an idea of place, which I like in wildlife photographs.  I''m not absolutely convinced by the framing, ''though.', '2014-04-16 09:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7204198, 1109016, 129147, '<td valign="top">Would like to see more detail in the eye.</td>', 'Would like to see more detail in the eye.', '2014-04-16 09:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7204200, 1109207, 67258, '<td valign="top">It must be so exciting to be able to see birds such as these in the wild! The blues and lilacs of the plumage are lovely, as is the metalic sheen you have captured.  The greens of the bokeh are a good foil.  At some point I would be interested to see a wider shot, with some idea of scale.</td>', 'It must be so exciting to be able to see birds such as these in the wild! The blues and lilacs of the plumage are lovely, as is the metalic sheen you have captured.  The greens of the bokeh are a good foil.  At some point I would be interested to see a wider shot, with some idea of scale.', '2014-04-16 09:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7204203, 1109413, 129147, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, wish it weren''t flying out of frame.</td>', 'Nice colors, wish it weren''t flying out of frame.', '2014-04-16 09:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7204205, 1108895, 67258, '<td valign="top">You can always find some wildlife (I have a feeling insects were supposed to be excluded form the challenge, but happy to overlook that), wherever you are!  Nicely captured with the perfect dof.  For me, the ends of the blades of grass don''t add anything to the photo.</td>', 'You can always find some wildlife (I have a feeling insects were supposed to be excluded form the challenge, but happy to overlook that), wherever you are!  Nicely captured with the perfect dof.  For me, the ends of the blades of grass don''t add anything to the photo.', '2014-04-16 09:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7204207, 1108987, 67258, '<td valign="top">Awww, super sweet.  Oops, wrong challenge ;P<br/> <br/>A really appealing wildlife photo with a hint of environment and behaviour.</td>', 'Awww, super sweet.  Oops, wrong challenge ;P A really appealing wildlife photo with a hint of environment and behaviour.', '2014-04-16 09:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7204208, 1109388, 129147, '<td valign="top">That''s some kind of camo!</td>', 'That''s some kind of camo!', '2014-04-16 09:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7204210, 1109443, 67258, '<td valign="top">A heron in its nest makes an interesting variation on the subject.  Looks like this was at the limit of your camera/lens'' capabilities, but a worthwhile shot nonetheless.</td>', 'A heron in its nest makes an interesting variation on the subject.  Looks like this was at the limit of your camera/lens'' capabilities, but a worthwhile shot nonetheless.', '2014-04-16 09:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7204212, 1109424, 67258, '<td valign="top">an interesting choice going mono - not convinced it works for me.  The photo does look a little soft, and could perhaps do with more sharpening.</td>', 'an interesting choice going mono - not convinced it works for me.  The photo does look a little soft, and could perhaps do with more sharpening.', '2014-04-16 09:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7204213, 1109267, 67258, '<td valign="top">Looks like it is having a go at the splits!</td>', 'Looks like it is having a go at the splits!', '2014-04-16 09:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7204226, 1109408, 67258, '<td valign="top">The square crop is a good move, as is the retro feel given by the border, but at the end of the day, there just isn''t enough detail and the image is too dark to appeal to me.</td>', 'The square crop is a good move, as is the retro feel given by the border, but at the end of the day, there just isn''t enough detail and the image is too dark to appeal to me.', '2014-04-16 10:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7204227, 1109397, 67258, '<td valign="top">Nature, yes, and a pleasing photo, and whilst I am sure there is some wildlife in there, I can''t find it.</td>', 'Nature, yes, and a pleasing photo, and whilst I am sure there is some wildlife in there, I can''t find it.', '2014-04-16 10:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7204228, 1109227, 67258, '<td valign="top">Stunningly gorgeous - a perfect capture, and beautifully and sympathetically processed.</td>', 'Stunningly gorgeous - a perfect capture, and beautifully and sympathetically processed.', '2014-04-16 10:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7204229, 1109467, 67258, '<td valign="top">It''s a shame there is a shadow cutting across the bird''s head - a different position may have eliminated it.  I''m not hugely keen on the composition, I would prefer a bit more room for the bird to look into.</td>', 'It''s a shame there is a shadow cutting across the bird''s head - a different position may have eliminated it.  I''m not hugely keen on the composition, I would prefer a bit more room for the bird to look into.', '2014-04-16 10:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7204231, 1109176, 67258, '<td valign="top">Lovely light, pleasingly balanced composition, and an interesting pose from your feathered model.  As a niggle, it is a shame that the twigs have crept into the foreground as they do detract somewhat, but nonetheless, a good bird portrait.</td>', 'Lovely light, pleasingly balanced composition, and an interesting pose from your feathered model.  As a niggle, it is a shame that the twigs have crept into the foreground as they do detract somewhat, but nonetheless, a good bird portrait.', '2014-04-16 10:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7204232, 1109276, 67258, '<td valign="top">A little soft on the bird - I suspect that you focussed just a tad in front.  Our robins are completely different to the American version!</td>', 'A little soft on the bird - I suspect that you focussed just a tad in front.  Our robins are completely different to the American version!', '2014-04-16 10:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7204233, 1108841, 67258, '<td valign="top">A tree sparrow rather than the more common house sparrow.  These are becoming quite uncommon in large parts of the UK.  Personally I would have preferred a full portrait rather than a partial one, especially given that here the light is quite harsh.</td>', 'A tree sparrow rather than the more common house sparrow.  These are becoming quite uncommon in large parts of the UK.  Personally I would have preferred a full portrait rather than a partial one, especially given that here the light is quite harsh.', '2014-04-16 10:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7204234, 1109351, 67258, '<td valign="top">Ha, I''ve never seen one of these, except in the cartoon! What a strange looking bird - always appreciate seeing new things.</td>', 'Ha, I''ve never seen one of these, except in the cartoon! What a strange looking bird - always appreciate seeing new things.', '2014-04-16 10:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7204235, 1109253, 67258, '<td valign="top">Laid back, or what!  Fun capture.</td>', 'Laid back, or what!  Fun capture.', '2014-04-16 10:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
