(7204271, 1108909, 143086, '<td valign="top">how cute is that?!?!!! Perfectly framed. The lighting is nicely uneven too, and its face is nicely lit. K, I have to go hug something now.... :)</td>', 'how cute is that?!?!!! Perfectly framed. The lighting is nicely uneven too, and its face is nicely lit. K, I have to go hug something now.... :)', '2014-04-16 11:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
