(7204275, 1109228, 143086, '<td valign="top">What a beauty...the b&amp;w really brings out the contrast in the hair nicely</td>', 'What a beauty...the b&w really brings out the contrast in the hair nicely', '2014-04-16 12:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
