(7204411, 1108895, 54446, '<td valign="top">dnmc</td>', 'dnmc', '2014-04-16 17:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7204412, 1109298, 54446, '<td valign="top">dnmc</td>', 'dnmc', '2014-04-16 17:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7204415, 1109227, 19944, '<td valign="top">My only 10.  A sure winner.</td>', 'My only 10.  A sure winner.', '2014-04-16 17:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7204420, 1109381, 108580, '<td valign="top">I like the image and the moment of the birds caught in flight. Excellent photography apart from the very central crop and composition. However I am against the hand of man (the nest support) in any "Wildlife" imagery (although some crop it out of their images kudos that you didnt. Whilst it may be argued that this is to aid their numbers by providing a nesting base where natural trees or roosts might have been eradicated and protect them from predators (and the birds are wild) it still is human intervention and belongs in a "Nature" category. True wildlife images are taken in the ever decreasing WILD.</td>', 'I like the image and the moment of the birds caught in flight. Excellent photography apart from the very central crop and composition. However I am against the hand of man (the nest support) in any "Wildlife" imagery (although some crop it out of their images kudos that you didnt. Whilst it may be argued that this is to aid their numbers by providing a nesting base where natural trees or roosts might have been eradicated and protect them from predators (and the birds are wild) it still is human intervention and belongs in a "Nature" category. True wildlife images are taken in the ever decreasing WILD.', '2014-04-16 17:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7204424, 1109413, 108580, '<td valign="top">I have often toyed with the idea of how digital processing of a wildlife image can actually represent same. Your editing in this instance is succinct. Taking the smog filled grey world of a pigeon and freeing it from this by flight into a colourful (albeit over-saturated) blue space. It''s a good concept and I''ve rewarded it.</td>', 'I have often toyed with the idea of how digital processing of a wildlife image can actually represent same. Your editing in this instance is succinct. Taking the smog filled grey world of a pigeon and freeing it from this by flight into a colourful (albeit over-saturated) blue space. It''s a good concept and I''ve rewarded it.', '2014-04-16 17:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7204425, 1109060, 108580, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely shot with a typical studio BG not easy to do with birds and the obligatory "look" and catchlight. The vignetting is a common PP technique used by one of DPC''s regular birders. I''m not overly fond of it in true wildlife images but it is a firm favourite with DPC voters. Despite that I hope the image does well as it is one of the best focused and composed images in the challenge. with good BG separation.</td>', 'This is a lovely shot with a typical studio BG not easy to do with birds and the obligatory "look" and catchlight. The vignetting is a common PP technique used by one of DPC''s regular birders. I''m not overly fond of it in true wildlife images but it is a firm favourite with DPC voters. Despite that I hope the image does well as it is one of the best focused and composed images in the challenge. with good BG separation.', '2014-04-16 17:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7204430, 1109470, 167257, '<td valign="top">This is the biggest turtle I''ve ever seen.  Looks like it could snap your head off! 8</td>', 'This is the biggest turtle I''ve ever seen.  Looks like it could snap your head off! 8', '2014-04-16 18:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7204431, 1108770, 108580, '<td valign="top">Great DOF and crisp eye as it should be. Good OOF BG albeit quite busy. Lovely colours and textures of the feathers. Garden bird? Did he get the worm?</td>', 'Great DOF and crisp eye as it should be. Good OOF BG albeit quite busy. Lovely colours and textures of the feathers. Garden bird? Did he get the worm?', '2014-04-16 18:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7204439, 1109198, 108580, '<td valign="top">I like the golds and silhouette. It''s not easy to catch birds in flight despite these being fairly far away. The composition is a bit too central for my liking still a nice image.</td>', 'I like the golds and silhouette. It''s not easy to catch birds in flight despite these being fairly far away. The composition is a bit too central for my liking still a nice image.', '2014-04-16 18:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7204440, 1109122, 108580, '<td valign="top">Birds in branches :) Interesting noisy post processing. Very unusual border, a first for DPC (at least that I''ve seen)</td>', 'Birds in branches :) Interesting noisy post processing. Very unusual border, a first for DPC (at least that I''ve seen)', '2014-04-16 18:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7204443, 1109450, 108580, '<td valign="top">Great moment caught and not easy to get bird with prey. Much patience is needed. The BG is very busy but that is wild photography. You get what you get sometimes. I feel a bit over sharpened but overall a nice result.</td>', 'Great moment caught and not easy to get bird with prey. Much patience is needed. The BG is very busy but that is wild photography. You get what you get sometimes. I feel a bit over sharpened but overall a nice result.', '2014-04-16 18:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7204448, 1109340, 108580, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done. Perfect exposure. DOF. The look. Composition It''s a pretty slow moving animal so this helps get the shot right but the other factors mentioned make this a clean and lovable image.</td>', 'Beautifully done. Perfect exposure. DOF. The look. Composition It''s a pretty slow moving animal so this helps get the shot right but the other factors mentioned make this a clean and lovable image.', '2014-04-16 18:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
