(7205357, 1109227, 86447, '<td valign="top">This is looking like a ribbonner... as I flip around...<br/> <br/> <br/>My favorite of the challenge:  10</td>', 'This is looking like a ribbonner... as I flip around...  My favorite of the challenge:  10', '2014-04-18 21:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7205525, 1108877, 67258, '<td valign="top">Some good detail in the heron, and crisp at the eye.  Personally I would prefer a lttle more space for the bird to fly into.</td>', 'Some good detail in the heron, and crisp at the eye.  Personally I would prefer a lttle more space for the bird to fly into.', '2014-04-19 15:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7205526, 1109345, 67258, '<td valign="top">I guess this was taken at the very limits of your cameras reach.  I think you did right not to be tempted to crop in, as I don''t think the detail is there to withstand it.  Despite the bird being very small in the frame, it is shown in its environment, and the fact that you spotted and managed to snap a shy bird gains you a mark.</td>', 'I guess this was taken at the very limits of your cameras reach.  I think you did right not to be tempted to crop in, as I don''t think the detail is there to withstand it.  Despite the bird being very small in the frame, it is shown in its environment, and the fact that you spotted and managed to snap a shy bird gains you a mark.', '2014-04-19 15:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7205529, 1108794, 67258, '<td valign="top">Really in the wild?  I find it hard to believe, tbh as it has a number of hallmarks of a zoo shot.  That said, I will have to take it in good faith and presume it was, perhaps taken on safari.   Compositionally I prefer the subject less centered, particularly in this case where the tiger is looking to the right - it makes the space to its left seem a bit redundant.  A tad over-exposed, as all detail seems to have been lost in the white on the left leg.  Focus and dof are spot on, wit the eye crisp, and also with a catch-light.</td>', 'Really in the wild?  I find it hard to believe, tbh as it has a number of hallmarks of a zoo shot.  That said, I will have to take it in good faith and presume it was, perhaps taken on safari.   Compositionally I prefer the subject less centered, particularly in this case where the tiger is looking to the right - it makes the space to its left seem a bit redundant.  A tad over-exposed, as all detail seems to have been lost in the white on the left leg.  Focus and dof are spot on, wit the eye crisp, and also with a catch-light.', '2014-04-19 15:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7205530, 1109068, 67258, '<td valign="top">Not sure if this is a heavy crop or there was some camera movement, but detail is poor, and focus is soft.  A good composition, though.</td>', 'Not sure if this is a heavy crop or there was some camera movement, but detail is poor, and focus is soft.  A good composition, though.', '2014-04-19 15:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7205532, 1109169, 67258, '<td valign="top">A bit too much softening/noise reduction for my tastes, particularly on the mallrd, but an aesthetically appealing image and some very pleasing light.</td>', 'A bit too much softening/noise reduction for my tastes, particularly on the mallrd, but an aesthetically appealing image and some very pleasing light.', '2014-04-19 15:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7205533, 1109450, 67258, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Such an interesting looking bird - it must be so exciting to see birds like this in the wild (I guess most of us feel like this about foreign species!).  The prized lunch (yuggh....) lifts this above many other bird portraits.  You do seem to have lost some detail in the plumage - maybe a bit too much noise-reduction?</td>', 'Very nice!  Such an interesting looking bird - it must be so exciting to see birds like this in the wild (I guess most of us feel like this about foreign species!).  The prized lunch (yuggh....) lifts this above many other bird portraits.  You do seem to have lost some detail in the plumage - maybe a bit too much noise-reduction?', '2014-04-19 15:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7205535, 1109272, 67258, '<td valign="top">Lovely!  Such a quiet and calm image, I can feel the stillness - although I guess the moment she (?) saw you it wasn''t quite as calm!</td>', 'Lovely!  Such a quiet and calm image, I can feel the stillness - although I guess the moment she (?) saw you it wasn''t quite as calm!', '2014-04-19 15:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
