(7207278, 1109368, 103142, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by pgirish007:</b></div><hr/><i> Question: Was this shot at 600mm and I believe handheld? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It''s recorded at 226mm -- and definitely cropped in. It was handheld -- a little soft in places, so some extra sharpening applied. <br/> <br/>The lens is extremely difficult to handhold at 600mm, but I''m getting a little more used to it, and I''ve had some successful handheld shots at that distance. I''m trying to use a tripod or a monopod with it, if possible.</td>', 'Originally posted by pgirish007: Question: Was this shot at 600mm and I believe handheld?   It''s recorded at 226mm -- and definitely cropped in. It was handheld -- a little soft in places, so some extra sharpening applied.  The lens is extremely difficult to handhold at 600mm, but I''m getting a little more used to it, and I''ve had some successful handheld shots at that distance. I''m trying to use a tripod or a monopod with it, if possible.', '2014-04-23 10:44:17.000000', NULL, 0),
